# A change to a workflow, to the delivery check's script or tests, or to this
# file merges only once a maintainer has approved it (AGENTS.md § Delivering).
# The workflow fetches scripts/check-delivery.sh from the branch a pull request
# targets, so a pull request that rewrote it would weaken every later check.
/.github/workflows/ @scscodes
/scripts/check-delivery.sh @scscodes
/scripts/test-delivery.sh @scscodes
/.github/CODEOWNERS @scscodes
